{"title":"Mock AIME 6 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_6_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/6/0965bf432b818b46740e3cd4d042899628c7ad0e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S(n)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"35\" height=\"18\" /> be the sum of the squares of the digits of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />.  How many positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/0/8d017187c9abd3f7348c80caaea4b7297850146c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n&gt;2007$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"71\" height=\"13\" /> satisfy the inequality <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/8/d188fef26ac5e06afc65a6e8fd320fad96e3a932.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n-S(n)\\le 2007$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"130\" height=\"18\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_6_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We start by rearranging the inequality the following way:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/4/9648b99ac65498cc01fea03d70ff90a8e2db0b56.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n-2007\\le S(n)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"133\" height=\"20\" /> and compare the possible values for the left hand side and the right hand side of this inequality.\n</p><p><br />\n<b>Case 1:</b> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> has 5 digits or more.\n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> = number of digits of n. \n</p><p>Then as a function of d, \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/8/658b1829d661e812938e10ba0e0284ead4470c5f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10^d \\le n &lt; 10^{d+1}-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"161\" height=\"20\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/f/62fff960816e451a72e60d14e03b78195fde9c8b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 \\le S(n) \\le 9^2d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"123\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/c/7ec3b57ed5019865226f26cfc4670d3386f0e1af.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10^d - 2007 \\le n-2007 &lt; 10^{d+1}-2008$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"306\" height=\"20\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/e/f7e7394c18f4aa987c926962ebb667d995445d42.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 \\le S(n) \\le 81d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"124\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/b/27be2ed4edaa2eeca95de7b64c491e7684504a94.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d \\ge 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"45\" height=\"17\" />, \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/2/d82a98145c516ec6fb488619f34607fe2a4e8dfc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10^d - 2007 \\ge 10^5 -2007$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"195\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/c/5ecc304655b675baf4de691b51d5046d662c919f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10^d - 2007 \\ge 10^5 -2007 &gt; 81d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"247\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/1/0011aabfdf2b3f6d2184abdeab621ce554f13c10.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10^d - 2007 &gt; 81d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"138\" height=\"19\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/b/27be2ed4edaa2eeca95de7b64c491e7684504a94.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d \\ge 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"45\" height=\"17\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/8/26851d6e04da34eb842afe392a8229580d63a557.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n-2007\\not\\le S(n)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"133\" height=\"20\" /> and there is <b>no possible <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /></b> when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> has 5 or more digits.\n</p><p><br />\n<b>Case 2:</b> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> has 4 digits and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/3/b83d27cb6e323720c333f96b732f6943867cd5e5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\ge 3000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"73\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/5/da5c7529f010bbc398583f1d928bbf22d1bca7bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3000 \\le n \\le 9999$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"134\" height=\"16\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/c/78c9dd2590398438327ea3767d80939fa97bdb4b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^2 \\le S(n) \\le 3^2+3 \\times 9^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"191\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/d/dad2b8b8110d99bb41aa520c83c976bcf33a6e8b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$993 \\le n-2007 \\le 7992$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"183\" height=\"16\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/5/855859eab6ee067cde5306445f22476282fe7cd7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9 \\le S(n) \\le 252$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"124\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/c/0fc687e08e5c72ff9694ff7ccc1ca86ba18a8a76.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$993 &gt; 252$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"81\" height=\"15\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/8/26851d6e04da34eb842afe392a8229580d63a557.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n-2007\\not\\le S(n)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"133\" height=\"20\" /> and there is <b>no possible <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /></b> when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> has 4 digits and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/3/b83d27cb6e323720c333f96b732f6943867cd5e5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\ge 3000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"73\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n<b>Case 3:</b> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/3/18366f066cfb95670dc5009824af97dacda3bf2f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2200 \\le n \\le 2999$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"134\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/f/3afc0bd21c2967e647ed552aee0b2954c17b246e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\le k \\le 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"79\" height=\"17\" /> be the 2nd digit of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/d/99d3588fb5ffea665290fdaf8cc5c95aa30fe1bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2000+100k \\le n \\le 2099+100k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"253\" height=\"17\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/6/fa6e3d3959a945f5c17a95c8d7b7fa7470fa4f54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^2+k^2 \\le S(n) \\le 2^2+k^2+2 \\times 9^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"270\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/9/3e9822066f48ff211701a8772fee78b5a70599f0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100k-7 \\le n-2007 \\le 100k+92$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"266\" height=\"17\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/3/f93d181afab0f6007a9d43c8279e6fca83e255d7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4+k^2 \\le S(n) \\le 166+k^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"203\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p>At <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/6/4f681bd84648c174d45eed0037702cae77ed0686.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k=2$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/a/48a609d0a627c0cd470911cea6b0b0b374c2bcd3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100k-7=193\\;\\;86+k^2=170$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"241\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/1/f71fa3350dc12ea254874a00d0b2aa3e01809d6c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$193&gt;170$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"81\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>At <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/5/3359f43f0fd0ed3b672d389374aecd0360921a47.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k=3$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/3/12353a685c855cd9d8b87645c080a5bd740e75ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100k-7=293\\;\\;86+k^2=175$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"241\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/f/11fce83b10f0ef4d7cbd7256f994d83068fdadb9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$293&gt;175$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"81\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>At <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/a/eeae143c5c9dbd376ffa1ffa8bdb93a58e8c9889.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/7/ee725107a8081853ff12170d30a475c689413989.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100k-7=393\\;\\;86+k^2=182$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"241\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/5/24515d4490bef59fbd1f72fb3ece7ee74790d72e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$393&gt;182$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"81\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>At <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/5/ce5bb215d21ddfbe2ec17a99cb7118ca80e4a2ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k=5$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/3/d73cb97af928a68afdbe4f7b89b4e70e05e34427.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100k-7=493\\;\\;86+k^2=191$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"241\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/b/1cb17d441b6911653aa0afe4eca001b661c27a95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$493&gt;191$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"81\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>At <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/9/a295acb9662ee1bae4bb3aa92a1f42b2cfd83f10.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k=6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/5/bd5f94aa5115308874563cf1d56dd89e2bd8e52e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100k-7=593\\;\\;86+k^2=202$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"241\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/d/87d443d0bb6d646ba697e080c749c5950adc6c17.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$593&gt;202$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"81\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>At <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/f/a9f2444faa6428da1ca9e40d6d0ecadb6498143f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k=7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/3/0f30675e1c575333c859feadec631cf62b585f2d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100k-7=693\\;\\;86+k^2=215$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"241\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/6/fe6467b70330c5efae3bd6dbbab6e6bc359adc69.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$693&gt;215$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"81\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>At <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/e/77eb455e13266e46765af4d7b5506c4e3a6b314d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k=8$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/a/27a0e93570176e20db7ee71fb435be0f8d98643a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100k-7=793\\;\\;86+k^2=230$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"241\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/f/2dfb12dc053ac3bd23aae2b559ecc2021d71d59b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$793&gt;230$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"81\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>At <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/6/0566a0e99ebec25620d813cbbedde7217e929ed4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k=9$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/2/9d2144166c792a57eb3d769da828da80b7dec938.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100k-7=893\\;\\;86+k^2=247$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"241\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/6/836d68fc94d4e8a7d7bb7329dfad0fc898a93c8e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$893&gt;247$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"81\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/1/9a1f641a9b0d2430abc9d9b8420f845f4874d721.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100k-7 &gt; 166+k^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"162\" height=\"18\" />, for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/f/3afc0bd21c2967e647ed552aee0b2954c17b246e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\le k \\le 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"79\" height=\"17\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/8/26851d6e04da34eb842afe392a8229580d63a557.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n-2007\\not\\le S(n)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"133\" height=\"20\" /> and there is <b>no possible <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /></b> when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/5/b752c508d2b6c557c5b7c4541b617bedef5becd1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\ge 2200$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"73\" height=\"16\" /> when combined with the previous cases.\n</p><p><br />\n<b>Case 4:</b> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/a/62ae7856e3bfac4efa29ae435b1163d71f9aff3a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2100 \\le n \\le 2199$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"134\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/b/90b625eae8e95ce3dbfa9fdefb40efb0036b7496.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 \\le k \\le 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"79\" height=\"17\" /> be the 3rd digit of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/6/d26d7ef84906dc347129d22c172a87ff09a71a67.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2100+10k \\le n \\le 2109+10k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"235\" height=\"17\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/5/795a25f631ea1a06142557c8f5c245fc0c88ac62.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^2+1^2+k^2 \\le S(n) \\le 2^2+1^2+k^2+9^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"316\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/a/45a5d0f9082a51564e2cfb726cabf4195bd3dd79.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10k+93 \\le n-2007 \\le 10k+102$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"266\" height=\"17\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/0/c206b1151b48b5d0dcbe05af39a40ef8caee393b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5+k^2 \\le S(n) \\le 86+k^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"194\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p>At <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/d/badf0ecd1ef8289387d8462393438c6e2710ff28.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k=0$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/4/b7463aa5759e78be30826353cdebbb46137b41c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10k+93=93\\;and\\;86+k^2=86$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"253\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/a/a0abac6dcd497df488b19365db2b17b321e9e544.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$93&gt;86$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"62\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>At <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/d/5ed8470bc717a49aafe4556c7e2c2e11ddc7b687.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/a/7ea42e1d05974c195a81c83a08c92156ef965a2e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10k+93=103\\;and\\;86+k^2=87$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"262\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/8/48876721d2c25d09653af0d083f8d2b1342f3baf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$103&gt;87$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"72\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>At <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/6/4f681bd84648c174d45eed0037702cae77ed0686.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k=2$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/f/d8f18aa2855f7d3d02a0fa20876732a906343eaa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10k+93=113\\;and\\;86+k^2=90$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"262\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/4/6d413018c8067f5ceb771